llious ex-assassin Killua in the exam, with their friendship prevailing throughout the many trials and threats they come upon taking on the dangerous career of a Hunter."}],"upcoming":[{"id":195516,"title":{"romaji":"Kusuriya no Hitorigoto 3rd Season","english":"The Apothecary Diaries Season 3"},"coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx195516-FWHIFQMvCjVj.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx195516-FWHIFQMvCjVj.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx195516-FWHIFQMvCjVj.jpg"},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","genres":["Drama","Mystery"],"averageScore":null,"description":"The third season of <i>Kusuriya no Hitorigoto</i>.\n<br><br>\nIn the aftermath of the Shi Clan’s rebellion, things have finally settled down, and Maomao has returned to her old life as a pharmacist in the pleasure district.\n<br><br>\nOne day, triggered by a breakfast served at the Verdigris House, Maomao senses an anomaly and begins investigating its true nature.\n<br><br>\nMeanwhile, Jinshi, who has revealed his true identity as the Imperial brother and begun to face his heavy responsibilities, is deeply troubled by the final message left by Loulan: a warning of an impending \"disaster that will strike the nation.\"\n<br><br>\nTo make matters worse, rumors of a mysterious shrine maiden who deceives the people begin to spread, casting a dark shadow over the country of Li once again.\n<br><br>\nFrom the depths of the inner court to the city streets, and across foreign borders—the world grows wider, and the stakes even higher for Maomao and Jinshi.<br><br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)"},{"id":195604,"title":{"romaji":"Black Clover 2nd Season","english":"Black Clover Season 2"},"coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx195604-BjvWdT5jOcM6.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/ani